{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0273_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9c77aaad009719141244264480749f6043075847aa9fe274cba50ae01f548019", "ja": "それは、パジャマをデザインしてみたいってことか？\nふむ……たとえば、どんな？", "zh": "你的意思是想试着设计睡衣吗？\n嗯……比如说，想设计成什么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0273_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "872647aaea771882ec118258befe160234f4058aafe783260f50104cbed9b9df", "ja": "そうですね……アーバンながらも、ナチュラルを\n取り入れたロハス＆リラックスをテーマにします！", "zh": "没错……主题就定为融入自然元素的都市风格，打造LOHAS＆放松感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0273_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "4625731bf192e6c7d85a3cbe9ed3bd7f7a5b9b2e8e2708b58ebeaf22b0e437bc", "ja": "いっそ、パジャマだけじゃなくて、枕とシーツ、\nインテリアにアメニティまでロコナイズして……。", "zh": "干脆不仅是睡衣，枕头、床单、\n室内装潢乃至洗漱用品都彻底ROCO化……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0273_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "9c2bd9a1a2d851f3bf86df1e7da291c597b8ee0521f9813a517fa26a7ec762fd", "ja": "最終的にはホテルのルーム全てを\nプロデュースしてみたいって思います！", "zh": "最终，我想尝试把酒店的整个房间都制作出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0273_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a7bb00a076294f9e4506cd9ea5a2f57781d9624719564201af053d8dcde70b98", "ja": "コラボルームみたいな感じか……。\nうん、面白そうだな。企画書を書いてみようか。", "zh": "原来是联动房间那种感觉吗……嗯，感觉会很有意思。要不我来写份企划书吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0273_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "b7c501993f143fc146f6cfc8cfb6f390914c37a2c28bc16d129ffe8043995940", "ja": "本当ですか！？　あ、あともしコラボが\n実現したら……もう一つしたいことがあって！", "zh": "真的吗！？啊，还有，如果联动能实现的话……我还有一件想做的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0273_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "0c76caf403ea6edcce2a97a2f96696b406b0cf3ebdf3e66f041f212bdf501617", "ja": "コラボルームのベッドは、\nキングサイズがいいんです！　お願いできませんか？", "zh": "联动房间的床，我想要特大床！可以拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
